<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fruit of the Loom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fruit of the Loom raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised Fruit of the Loom Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Fruit of the Loom's long-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
